# Shopify Storefront API Configuration
# Replace these values with your actual Shopify store credentials in a new ".env" file.

# 1. Your Shopify Store Domain (e.g., your-store-name.myshopify.com)
VITE_SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN=your-store-name.myshopify.com

# 2. Your Shopify Storefront Access Token (Public read-only token)
# To generate this:
# - Log into Shopify Admin.
# - Go to Settings > Apps and sales channels > Develop apps.
# - Click "Create an app".
# - Under "Configuration", configure "Storefront API integration".
# - Select the necessary scopes (e.g., read products, collections, checkout).
# - Install the app, go to "API credentials", and copy the "Storefront API access token".
VITE_SHOPIFY_STOREFRONT_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_storefront_access_token_here
